---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Clinical Services & Consultations">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-4 border-b border-stone-200 pb-6">
      <span class="badge-reviewed">Clinical Scope</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1B4332]">Endocrinology Services & Care Pathways</h1>
      <p class="text-stone-600 text-base max-w-3xl">
        Evidence-led diagnostic consultations, continuous metabolic monitoring, specialized endocrine imaging, and ongoing care coordination in Austin, TX.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="text-2xl">🦋</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1B4332]">Thyroid Care & In-Office Imaging</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          Comprehensive thyroid diagnostic workup including TSH, Free T4, Free T3, Anti-TPO, and Thyroglobulin antibodies. High-resolution in-office neck ultrasound and ultrasound-guided Fine Needle Aspiration (FNA) biopsy for thyroid nodule risk stratification.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-stone-700 list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 pt-1">
          <li>Hypothyroidism & Levothyroxine/Liothyronine dose titration</li>
          <li>Graves' disease & Anti-thyroid medication monitoring</li>
          <li>ACR TI-RADS nodule risk scoring & surveillance</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/treatments/thyroid-ultrasound/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2D6A4F] hover:underline inline-block pt-2">Learn About Thyroid Ultrasound →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="text-2xl">📈</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1B4332]">Comprehensive Diabetes & CGM Care</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          Personalized glycemic control strategies for Type 1, Type 2, prediabetes, and gestational diabetes. Continuous Glucose Monitor (CGM) sensor placement, data analysis, and insulin pump basal/bolus optimization.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-stone-700 list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 pt-1">
          <li>Prediabetes reversal & lifestyle/metabolic plans</li>
          <li>Dexcom G7 / Freestyle Libre 3 data interpretation</li>
          <li>Automated insulin delivery (Omnipod, Tandem, Medtronic)</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/treatments/continuous-glucose-monitoring/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2D6A4F] hover:underline inline-block pt-2">Learn About CGM Technology →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="text-2xl">⚖️</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1B4332]">PCOS & Hormonal Imbalance</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          Targeted management of Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS), insulin resistance, hyperandrogenism, irregular menses, perimenopause, and evidence-based hormone replacement therapy.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-stone-700 list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 pt-1">
          <li>Fast-acting insulin sensitivity protocols</li>
          <li>Androgen blocker & ovulation support coordination</li>
          <li>Evidence-based perimenopausal hormone balancing</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/conditions/pcos/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2D6A4F] hover:underline inline-block pt-2">Explore PCOS Care →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
        <div class="text-2xl">🦴</div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-[#1B4332]">Osteoporosis & Bone Densitometry</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
          Central DEXA scan T-score and Z-score evaluation, FRAX fracture risk calculation, secondary osteoporosis screening, and anti-resorptive/anabolic bone therapies.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-xs text-stone-700 list-disc pl-4 space-y-1 pt-1">
          <li>Secondary osteoporosis cause discovery (Vitamin D, PTH)</li>
          <li>Bisphosphonate, Denosumab, & Parathyroid hormone analogues</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/treatments/bone-density-dexa-scan-evaluation/" class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2D6A4F] hover:underline inline-block pt-2">Bone Densitometry Details →</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#E8F5E9] p-6 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-serif font-bold text-[#1B4332]">Ready to Schedule Your Initial Consultation?</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-600">Initial visits include a thorough 60-minute review of past labs, symptoms, and medical history.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/booking/" class="btn-primary text-sm whitespace-nowrap">Book Appointment Online</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
